     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Mon, Mar 3, 2014 at 10:28 PM, topcrown <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">renalcl...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br>\r\n\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi-<div><br></div><div>I am using this code to plot box plots and along with the data below it.  Thank you in advance</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div>Here are my questions:<br></div><div><ul><li><span style=\"line-height:normal\">I want to fill the box plots with specific colors for Group, where 1=red and 3=blue.  How can this be done?</span></li></ul>\r\n\r\n</div></div></blockquote><div class=\"gmail_default\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">?scale_fill_manual</font><br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><ul><li><span style=\"line-height:normal\">How can I get open circles for shape?</span></li></ul></div></div></blockquote><div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">\r\n\r\n​geom_point(shape=1)​</div></div><div><br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n<div><ul><li><span style=\"line-height:normal\"> </span></li><li><span style=\"line-height:normal\">How can I display the numerical value for the mean line on the plot?</span></li></ul></div><div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">\r\n\r\n​?stat_summary and ?geom_text<span style=\"font-family:arial\"> </span></div></div></div></blockquote><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">​</div><br></div></div></blockquote><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">Best,</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:&#39;courier new&#39;,monospace\">Ista​​</div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-style:solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><div></div><div><br></div><div><b><font color=\"#0000ff\">ggplot(table, aes(factor(Time),y=Value)) + geom_boxplot() +theme_bw()+geom_jitter()</font></b><br></div><div><br></div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n </font></span><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n</font></span><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"260\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:260pt\">\r\n\r\n <colgroup><col width=\"65\" span=\"4\" style=\"width:65pt\">\r\n </colgroup><tbody><tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" width=\"65\" style=\"height:15pt;width:65pt\"><b>Group</b></td>\r\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\"><b>Point</b></td>\r\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\"><b>Time</b></td>\r\n  <td width=\"65\" style=\"width:65pt\"><b>Value</b></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:15pt\">1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">101</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">12</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">104</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"15\" style=\"height:15pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"15\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:15pt\">1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">102</td>\r\n  <td align=